			<div class="content" id="post-content-1432022">
									

<p>&quot;When a human enters the building, and uses the elevator, stairs, or other method to reach the third floor, SCP-1270-1 will attempt to shoot them to death. The entity has never ran out of ammunition thus far and has good aim.&quot;</p>
